00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:48.980
before you start using
the service, what we do

00:22:48.980 --> 00:22:50.855
and why we ask for
certain things.

00:22:50.855 --> 00:22:52.230
THERESE MANNHEIMER:
I think also,

00:22:52.230 --> 00:22:54.420
it's very, very
important to stress

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:57.570
that we're dealing with the
most sensitive of health data

00:22:57.570 --> 00:22:58.960
you can ever imagine.

00:22:58.960 --> 00:23:02.670
And so of course data
encryption, data security,

00:23:02.670 --> 00:23:06.120
the storage of the data
is incredibly important,

00:23:06.120 --> 00:23:10.560
so that we will never
be facing being hacked,

00:23:10.560 --> 00:23:14.160
or any type of leakage of
this data, since it's probably

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:16.830
the most sensitive data
you can ever come across.

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:21.990
So ensuring each and every
user's integrity and privacy

00:23:21.990 --> 00:23:24.420
is top priority for us.

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:26.940
And it's also very
important, for example,

00:23:26.940 --> 00:23:29.670
