business model that

00:23:29.670 --> 00:23:34.230
entails the handling of data,
which means that we want

00:23:34.230 --> 00:23:36.360
all of our users and
the women to understand

00:23:36.360 --> 00:23:39.690
the value of the data
that we have on them,

00:23:39.690 --> 00:23:42.210
and to also have them
grant access whenever

00:23:42.210 --> 00:23:46.830
we suggest a collaboration or
say, you seem to be pregnant!

